  "findings": [
    {
      "level": "warn",
      "id": "license-drift",
      "lines": [
        "The licence is stated differently: agpl (appinfo/info.xml), AGPL-3.0-only (package.json), AGPL (composer.json).",
        "  Whoever redistributes the app has to pick one of them, and the App Store shows the one from info.xml.",
        "  agpl in appinfo/info.xml is a deprecated App Store value, shown there as AGPLv3+, which is AGPL-3.0-or-later. With min-version 35 info.xml can state an SPDX id instead.",
        "  No SPDX id: AGPL (composer.json). Only an SPDX id says which licence is meant, and for a GNU licence whether -only or -or-later.",
        "  No LICENSES/ directory, so the licence text itself is not in the checkout, which is what REUSE and the distributions check for."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "node-version",
      "lines": [
        "Node 24 stated in build.yml, lint.yml, release.yml, within package.json engines.node >=24.0.0.",
        "  Not stated in .nvmrc, so nothing keeps the other places from drifting away from it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "tooling",
      "lines": [
        "Tooling in the checkout: ESLint (.eslintrc.js, superseded form), Stylelint (stylelint.config.js), PHPUnit (tests/phpunit.xml), PHP-CS-Fixer (.php-cs-fixer.dist.php).",
        " ESLint is configured in .eslintrc.js: ESLint 9 reads the flat config only; the eslintrc form, an .eslintrc file or the eslintConfig key in package.json, is ignored unless the run is pinned to ESLint 8.",
        " No Psalm configuration: the PHP side has no static analysis, which is what catches a wrong type before the server does.",
        " No REUSE configuration: licensing is not machine-checkable, which the App Store and every distribution ask for.",
        " No EditorConfig configuration: indentation is whatever each contributor's editor does."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "unreferenced-dependencies",
      "lines": [
        "7 declared packages are named nowhere in the checkout: @nextcloud/auth, @nextcloud/axios, @nextcloud/logger, @babel/plugin-proposal-class-properties, @babel/plugin-transform-modules-commonjs, @babel/plugin-transform-shorthand-properties, cli-progress.",
        "  Searched as literal names over 9,286 files, package.json excluded apart from its non-dependency fields, lockfiles excluded; then as an ESLint shorthand, as what TypeScript takes from a tsconfig, and as a peer of an installed package in package-lock.json. A package loaded some other way is not named anywhere either, so this is a list to check, not a list to remove."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "ok",
      "id": "versions-agree",
      "lines": [
        "Version 2.4.0 in appinfo/info.xml and package.json."
      ]
